; Fixture-only module. The exported thunk names are generated from XGAMERUNTIME_THUNK_TABLE in
; xgameruntime_shim.cpp with __declspec(dllexport). Listing them here as well
; would create a second source of truth, so this file only fixes the DLL name.
; No export ordinals are declared: this fixture does not guess Xbox ordinals.
LIBRARY xgameruntime
